flowchart LR
  OP[Operation<br/>e.g. get_contacts] --> PORTAL[Portal<br/>one method per capability]
  PORTAL --> PROV{PROVIDERS<br/>static, per capability}
  PROV -->|api first| API[ApiPortal<br/>fetch + cookies / Bearer]
  PROV -->|browser only where no API| BP[BrowserPortal<br/>navigate + in-page extractor]
  BP --> SESS[BrowserSession<br/>read-only guard: non-GET aborted,<br/>Login.jsp / app_blocked → typed errors]
  SESS --> PW[PlaywrightSession]
  PW -->|kind: chromium| CH[(bundled Chromium)]
  PW -->|kind: cdp| CDP[(any CDP endpoint,<br/>e.g. Obscura)]
  API --> EVA[Eva API]
  API --> REST[Webview REST]
  API --> LEG[legacy /rest<br/>read-only POST]
  CH & CDP --> JSP[JSP pages<br/>contacts · subjects · bookings · files]
  CH & CDP --> GATED[GDPR-gated JSP pages<br/>grades · documents · absence · criteria]
  WEB[[login --web<br/>headed browser, user does BankID,<br/>cookies stored encrypted]] -.->|web cookies preferred| SESS
  WEB -.->|same cookie header| REST
  classDef opt stroke-dasharray: 4 3
  class PW,CH,CDP,JSP,GATED,BP,SESS,WEB opt
